      "issue": 2,
      "title": "Add a divide function with divide-by-zero handling",
      "requirements": [
        "REQ-1: Add a divide(a, b) function to calculator.py that returns a / b",
        "REQ-2: Raise ValueError with a clear message when b is zero - do not return inf or None",
        "REQ-3: Follow the existing style: float type hints and a one-line docstring",
